    <div class=\"legend-card\">Click or drag on the grid to paint cells.</div>
    <div class=\"legend-card\">Press <b>Space</b> to start/pause · <b>N</b> for one step.</div>
    <div class=\"legend-card\">Right-click or hold <b>Shift</b> to erase.</div>
